   * how a meeting ends up arguing about which is current. Nothing is lost: every figure in those
   * panels appears above, from the same values, because the board hands the sheet what it already
   * computed rather than letting it derive anything.
   *
   * The bed grid stays on paper. It is the picture, not a list, and the sheet does not reproduce it.
   */
  /*
   * **MEASURED OFF THE DARK-THEME SHEET, NOT REASONED ABOUT — and it would have lost the whole of
