   *
   * On screen the sheet is near-white ink (`--text`, measured `rgb(244, 246, 248)` in dark) on the
   * panel's own `--surface-chrome` fill (measured `rgb(14, 18, 22)`), which is correct on a dark
   * screen and is a trap on paper: a printer drops fills, and what is left is white ink on white
