   * ground and the PAGE's own ink, so the sheet is black on white whatever the screen was set to,
   * and every hairline on it is drawn in ink rather than in a theme border colour that is pale by
   * design. `Canvas`/`CanvasText` resolve against the print medium because `.screen` declares
   * `color-scheme: light` at the top of this block.
